        prerequisites = listOf(),
        interferesWith = listOf(),
        family = "REPORTED",
        stage = 1
    )

    val COMPLEX_SYNTAX = GrammarConcept(
        id = "COMPLEX_SYNTAX",
        title = "Connecting ideas",
        lesson = "Cohesive C1 writing chains clauses with connectors: одна́ко (however), поэ́тому (therefore), несмотря́ на то что (despite the fact that), в то вре́мя как (whereas), благодаря́ тому́ что (thanks to). They let you subordinate and contrast precisely.",
